<title>FRANCE: Alliance Sante/Unichem in Portuguese jv.</title>
<headline>Alliance Sante/Unichem in Portuguese jv.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Sante said on Monday it was linking its drug distribution activities in Portugal with those of Britain's Unichem Plc.</p>
<p>In a statement Alliance Sante said the two companies would set up a 50-50 joint venture, Unichem/Alliance Sante Portugal, with sales of over 1.6 billion francs.</p>
<p>The new company will be the main drug wholesaler in Portugal with 10 distribution centers and a market share of over 20 percent.</p>
<p>Alliance Sante controls the ERPI and IFP companies in France and Alleanza Salute in Italy.</p>
</text>
